eną.","Bus 95 pesai.","Grynaisiais ar kortele?","Grynaisiais.","Žinoma, galima grynaisiais.","Prašom.","Ačiū. Štai Jūsų grąža.","Ar duoti maišelį?","Štai receptas.","Pažiūrėkime… Amoksicilinas, 500 miligramų: po vieną kapsulę kas aštuonias valandas penkias dienas.","Kurį duoti – originalų ar generinį?","Generinį, prašau.","Gerai, generinis.","Kadangi tai antibiotikas, turiu užantspauduoti receptą.","Išgerkite visą kursą, net jei pasijusite geriau.","Štai Jūsų vaistai.","Bus 85 pesai.","Ne, ačiū, maišelio nereikia.","Jokių problemų.","Greitai pasveikite!","Laba diena! Ką Jums šiandien paduoti?","Karščiuoju.","Oi, kaip nesmagu!","Ar vartojate kokių nors kitų vaistų?","Geriu vaistus nuo kraujospūdžio.","Rekomenduočiau paracetamolį.","Gerai, kaip norite.","Sveikite!","Esant aukštam kraujospūdžiui, geriau nevartokite ibuprofeno.","Geriau duosiu Jums paracetamolio.","Gerai, generinis. Prašom.","Ar tinka vaikams?","Vaikams yra vaikiška forma.","Vaikams dozė priklauso nuo svorio; ji nurodyta ant dėžutės.","Ar reikia recepto?","Ne, parduodamas be recepto.","Po vieną ar dvi tabletes kas aštuonias valandas.","Negerkite daugiau kaip šešių per dieną.","Ar gerti valgant?","Su maistu ar be jo – nesvarbu.","Ar dar ko nors reikės?","Tai viskas, ačiū.","Bus 25 pesai.","Kortele, prašau.","Priglauskite kortelę… Viskas, praėjo.","Taip, prašau.","Prašom, maišelyje.","Jei per kelias dienas nepraeis, eikite pas gydytoją.","Labas rytas! Kaip laikotės?","Puikiai, ačiū, kad paklausėte!","Malonu girdėti!","Sakykite, ką Jums paduoti?","Gal duotumėte loratadiną?","Žinoma.","Originalaus nebeliko, bet turiu generinį: tas pats, tik pigesnis.","Prašom.","Kaip dažnai jį gerti?","Viena tabletė per dieną.","Ir mieguistumo nesukelia.","Bus 45 pesai.","Sveiki! Kaip laikotės?","Iš viso 45 pesai.","Ar galiu sumokėti telefonu?","Taip, priglauskite jį prie terminalo… Viskas, praėjo.","Ar tai Jums?","Tai mano sūnui.","O ar vartoja kokių nors vaistų?","Ne, jokių, ačiū.","Rekomenduočiau ibuprofeną.","Vaikams geriau vaikiška forma – sirupas.","Iš viso 35 pesai.","Ar priimate korteles?","Jei per porą dienų nepagerės, nuveskite pas gydytoją.","Labas rytas! Kuo galiu Jums padėti?","Ar turite geriamojo rehidratacinio tirpalo?","Štai.","Kaip jį naudoti?","Gerkite jį mažais gurkšneliais visą dieną.","Ir gerkite daug vandens. Jei per dvi dienas nepagerės, eikite pas gydytoją.","Bus 35 pesai.","Ne, man ir taip gerai, ačiū.","Sveiki, užeikite! Kuo galiu padėti?","Jaučiuosi blogai.","Kokie Jūsų simptomai?","Tai imsite?","Jei norite, turiu ir paracetamolį.","Žinoma, ačiū!","Kaip jį gerti?","Iš viso 25 pesai.","Sveiki! Malonu Jus vėl matyti. Atėjote nusipirkti vaistų pagal receptą?","Ar esate alergiška penicilinui?","Gerai, originalus.","Iš viso 210 pesų.","Peršalau.","Tam galiu Jums duoti vaistą nuo peršalimo.","Po vieną kapsulę kas aštuonias valandas.","Atsargiai: sukelia mieguistumą, tad po to geriau nevairuokite.","Dar kas nors?","Taip, imsiu.","Bus 130 pesų.","Ar turite alergiją kokiems nors vaistams?","Esu alergiška penicilinui.","Gerai, ačiū, kad pasakėte.","Puiku!","Kuo galiu Jums padėti?","Ar turite paracetamolio?","Nuo kada Jums tokie simptomai?","Nuo vakar.","Ar turite loratadino?","Gerai, originalus. Prašom.","Gerai. Tik primenu:","Iš viso 175 pesai.","Gal duotumėte ibuprofeną?","Ar turite klausimų?","Puiku.","Smagu girdėti!","Ar galima kartu gerti alkoholį?","Su šiais vaistais geriau negerkite alkoholio.","Ar sukelia mieguistumą?","Ne, mieguistumo nesukelia.","Iš viso 95 pesai.","Rekomenduočiau vaistą nuo peršalimo.","Iš viso 130 pesų.","Nuo kada taip jaučiatės?","Kiek per dieną?","Iš viso 85 pesai.","Bus 210 pesų.","Jau tris dienas.","Tai duoti Jums?","Bus 175 pesai.","Tam galiu Jums duoti paracetamolį."],"turns":[[0,"¡Buenas tardes! ¿Qué le damos?","Good afternoon! What can I get you?","ff8663f29134",2.35],[-1,"Me duele la cabeza.","I have a headache.",1],[0,"¡Híjole! Lo siento.","Oh no, I'm sorry.","063e4fc1ef49",2.92],[0,"Para eso, le puedo dar ibuprofeno.","For that, I can give you ibuprofen.","c979e5647ff3",3.69],[0,"¿Se lo doy?","Would you like it?","7ec3e05e4a07",0.84],[-1,"Sí, está bien.","Yes, that's fine.",1],[0,"¿De patente o genérico?","Brand-name or generic?","3ed8f534f0f3",2.28],[-1,"No, no tomo nada.","No, I'm not taking anything.",1],[0,"Ajá.","Uh-huh.","e55071738b55",0.93],[0,"¿Entonces, de patente o genérico?","So, brand-name or generic?","ffd677997414",3.09],[-1,"Sí, es para mí.","Yes, it's for me.",1],[0,"Con gusto.","Sure thing.","49d98ea55a8f",0.97],[0,"Muy bien.","Okay.","bcf9621844e6",0.59],[-1,"De patente, por favor.","Brand-name, please.",1],[0,"Muy bien, el de patente. Aquí tiene.","All right, the brand-name one. Here you go.","2d78caac348c",3.57],[0,"¿Sabe cómo se toma?","Do you know how to take it?","ebdaad370236",1.22],[-1,"No, gracias.","No, thanks.",1],[0,"Una tableta cada ocho horas, después de comer.","One tablet every eight hours, after eating.","fa2ffae76068",3.86],[0,"No tome más de tres al día.","Don't take more than three a day.","41ca78ece603",2.23],[0,"Serían noventa y cinco pesos.","That'll be 95 pesos.","5f73127f4780",2.99],[0,"¿Efectivo o tarjeta?","Cash or card?","0b9bf064ec22",2.24],[-1,"En efectivo.","Cash.",1],[0,"Claro, en efectivo.","Sure, cash is fine.","1eb543204f87",1.84],[-1,"Aquí tiene.","Here you go.",1],[0,"Gracias. Aquí tiene su cambio.","Thanks. Here's your change.","c0f59c778e12",2.37],[0,"¿Le doy una bolsita?","Would you like a bag?","1509e380385f",1.08],[-1,"Aquí está la receta.","Here's the prescription.",1],[0,"A ver… Amoxicilina de quinientos: una cápsula cada ocho horas, por cinco días.","Let's see… Amoxicillin, 500 milligrams: one capsule every eight hours for five days.","67983bb524a8",7.51],[0,"¿Cuál le doy, el de patente o el genérico?","Which would you like, brand-name or generic?","06d7d4a68317",3.16],[-1,"El genérico, por favor.","The generic, please.",1],[0,"Muy bien, la genérica.","All right, the generic.","b06bd847dfd7",2.74],[0,"Como es antibiótico, tengo que sellar la receta.","Since it's an antibiotic, I have to stamp the prescription.","f6fc64b27a61",3.05],[0,"Tómesela toda, aunque se sienta mejor.","Take all of it, even if you feel better.","5a8d10ff786e",3.26],[0,"Aquí tiene su medicina.","Here's your medicine.","4028e2fa589e",1.61],[0,"Serían ochenta y cinco pesos.","That'll be 85 pesos.","3908d9e8f133",2.57],[-1,"No, gracias, no necesito bolsa.","No thanks, I don't need a bag.",1],[0,"No hay problema.","No problem.","a6e151d21828",1.29],[0,"¡Que se alivie pronto!","I hope you feel better soon!","101414f6b3ee",1.55],[0,"¡Buenas tardes! ¿Qué le damos hoy?","Good afternoon! What can I get you today?","08b2498a8cf3",2.24],[-1,"Tengo fiebre.","I have a fever.",1],[0,"¡Ay, qué mal!","Oh, I'm sorry to hear that!","7e08a4ea52fe",1.66],[0,"¿Está tomando algún otro medicamento?","Are you taking any other medication?","c3393a381377",2.68],[-1,"Tomo pastillas para la presión.","I take blood pressure pills.",1],[0,"Le recomiendo paracetamol.","I'd recommend acetaminophen.","10e69eca829d",1.99],[0,"Está bien, como guste.","All right, whatever you prefer.","aa4622ac0f45",1.88],[0,"¡Que se mejore!","Feel better!","bdc92392f42a",1.28],[0,"Con la presión alta, mejor no tome ibuprofeno.","With high blood pressure, you'd better not take ibuprofen.","76cdb4821e20",3.52],[0,"Mejor le doy paracetamol.","I'd rather give you acetaminophen.","c5166dd6b0c1",1.54],[0,"Muy bien, el genérico. Aquí tiene.","All right, the generic. Here you go.","2127995ce181",4.29],[-1,"¿Sirve para niños?","Is it okay for children?",1],[0,"Para niños hay presentación infantil.","There's a children's version.","0e25d19969f7",2.65],[0,"Para niños, la dosis va según el peso; viene en la caja.","For children, the dose depends on their weight; it's on the box.","57e69a1fd09f",4.17],[-1,"¿Necesito receta?","Do I need a prescription?",1],[0,"No, se vende sin receta.","No, it's sold without a prescription.","457653540949",1.93],[0,"Una o dos tabletas cada ocho horas.","One or two tablets every eight hours.","a0d9c22f027a",2.98],[0,"No tome más de seis al día.","Don't take more than six a day.","efb26912eb31",1.78],[-1,"¿Se toma con alimentos?","Do I take it with food?",1],[0,"Con o sin alimentos, da igual.","With or without food, it doesn't matter.","d8c4cefda091",2.46],[0,"¿Se le ofrece algo más?","Can I get you anything else?","82edf59c6bbe",1.59],[-1,"Es todo, gracias.","That's all, thanks.",1],[0,"Serían veinticinco pesos.","That'll be 25 pesos.","34a676be68e6",2.3],[-1,"Con tarjeta, por favor.","Card, please.",1],[0,"Acerque su tarjeta… Listo, ya pasó.","Tap your card… Done, it went through.","ce8540261e07",4.4],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[0,"Aquí va, en su bolsita.","Here you go, in a bag.","760ffd8f455d",2.45],[0,"Si no se le quita en unos días, vaya al doctor.","If it doesn't go away in a few days, see a doctor.","b9e1af69a7c1",3.66],[0,"¡Buenos días! ¿Cómo está?","Good morning! How are you?","d4d5ecdbb650",2.25],[-1,"¡Excelente, gracias por preguntar!","Great, thanks for asking!",1],[0,"¡Me alegro!","Good to hear!","017d46a15115",0.76],[0,"Dígame, ¿qué le damos?","Go ahead, what can I get you?","b1a9a3683e7a",1.89],[-1,"¿Me da loratadina, por favor?","Can I have loratadine, please?",1],[0,"Claro.","Sure.","192b2ec29ee0",0.8],[0,"El de patente se me acabó, pero tengo el genérico: es lo mismo y más barato.","I'm out of the brand-name one, but I have the generic: it's the same thing, and cheaper.","7f9653535891",5.26],[0,"Aquí tiene.","Here you go.","5d7d4652b528",0.81],[-1,"¿Cada cuánto se toma?","How often do I take it?",1],[0,"Una tableta al día.","One tablet a day.","c27ccb9344b2",2.05],[0,"Y no da sueño.","And it won't make you drowsy.","585d639be02b",1.46],[0,"Serían cuarenta y cinco pesos.","That'll be 45 pesos.","49796195cf52",2.33],[-1,"¡Hola! ¿Cómo está?","Hi! How are you?",1],[0,"En total son cuarenta y cinco pesos.","That's 45 pesos altogether.","1a802772f12a",3.04],[-1,"¿Puedo pagar con el celul